(Outlook for 2025. The foundation's priorities for 2025 are the LumenDB 4.0) Tj T*
(release, onboarding Driftwood, and growing the number of sponsoring) Tj T*
(organisations to 35. The budget for 2025 assumes income of EUR 450,000.) Tj T*
